The issue is that Dafny can't prove `i in s.elements ==> i in union.elements` because it doesn't know that `s.elements` is a prefix of `elems` after the loop. I need to add an invariant capturing that relationship. Let me update:

```bash
python3 << 'PYEOF'
with open('program.dfy', 'r') as f:
    content = f.read()

old = '''            var i := 0;
            while (0 <= i < |this.elements|)
            decreases |this.elements| - i
            invariant 0 <= i <= |this.elements|
            invariant forall j : int :: 0 <= j < i ==> this.elements[j] in elems
            invariant forall j :: 0 <= j < |elems| ==> elems[j] in this.elements || elems[j] in s.elements
            invariant forall j, k :: 0 <= j < |elems| && 0 <= k < |elems| && j != k ==> elems[j] != elems[k]
            {
                if (this.elements[i] !in elems) {
                    elems := elems + [this.elements[i]];
                }
                i := i + 1;
            }'''

new = '''            var i := 0;
            while (0 <= i < |this.elements|)
            decreases |this.elements| - i
            invariant 0 <= i <= |this.elements|
            invariant s.elements <= elems
            invariant forall j : int :: 0 <= j < i ==> this.elements[j] in elems
            invariant forall j :: 0 <= j < |elems| ==> elems[j] in this.elements || elems[j] in s.elements
            invariant forall j, k :: 0 <= j < |elems| && 0 <= k < |elems| && j != k ==> elems[j] != elems[k]
            {
                if (this.elements[i] !in elems) {
                    elems := elems + [this.elements[i]];
                }
                i := i + 1;
            }'''

assert old in content, "Could not find the loop to replace"
content = content.replace(old, new)

with open('program.dfy', 'w') as f:
    f.write(content)

print("Done")
